in MTU engines, each delivering 2,186 HP, and with just 666 hours of use, this <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/azimut-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Azimut</a> ensures reliable and impressive performance. In 2019, the hull and superstructure were repainted in Awlcraft 2000, giving it a sleek and modern appearance. Additionally, the garage converts into a beach club, creating the perfect space to relax by the water.</p><p>This yacht is built to US specifications and includes CMC electric stabilizers and an ASEA Power Converter, making it ideal for smooth cruising and global exploration. With a beam of 22’6”, it offers generous space while maintaining refined elegance, making it a top choice for those seeking the pinnacle of luxury living on the water.</p><p>Explore the extraordinary features and custom upgrades that distinguish this 95’ Azimut, and experience the ultimate in yachting sophistication with this exceptional vessel.</p><p><strong>Asking Price:</strong></p><p>$5,900,000</p><p><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/yacht/95-ft-azimut-2017/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CHECK OUT THE FULL LISTING</a></p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/10/raul-faget.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p><b>Email</b>: raul@fyiyachts.com<br/><b>Cell</b>: 305-796-3649‬‬‬<br/><b>Office</b>: 305-854-6020</p><a href=\"tel:305-796-3649‬‬‬\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Call</a><a href=\"mailto:raul@fyiyachts.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Email</a><a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/yacht/65-ft-sunseeker-2022/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Listing</a><b>Share this post</b><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={URL}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/tweet?url={URL}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Check out this post&amp;body={URL}\" target=\"_blank